OL,3,GNEWSAShop closed by police over drug
OL,4,Adealing concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA shop has been subject to a
OL,7,Fthree-month closure order following
OL,8,Fconcerns over drug dealing at the
OL,9,Fpremises.
OL,11,FGreen Shop on Whitmore Street,
OL,12,FWhittlesey, near Peterborough, was shut
OL,13,Fon 7 August by Cambridgeshire Police's
OL,14,FMarch Neighbourhood Policing Team and
OL,15,Fthe extended order was granted at
OL,16,FCambridgeshire Magistrates' Court on
OL,17,FFriday.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
