OL,3,GNEWSAShop closed by police over drug
OL,4,Adealing concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn August, vapes and illicit cigarettes
OL,7,Fwere seized and a 22-year-old man was
OL,8,Fhanded a community resolution by the
OL,9,Fforce for being in possession of
OL,10,Fcannabis.
OL,12,FThe order stated the premises was
OL,13,Fclosed to everyone except for the
OL,14,Flandlord and their authorised
OL,15,Fcontractors, or members of the
OL,16,Femergency services.
